units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 single 3.0 5.0 5.0
create_atoms 1 single 3.8 5.0 5.0
create_atoms 2 single 6.5 5.2 5.0
create_atoms 2 single 7.0 4.6 5.4
mass * 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.6
pair_coeff 2 2 1.0 0.8
pair_coeff 1 2 1.0 1.2
compute ch all chunk/atom type
fix hull all graphics/chunk 1 ch
dump im all image 1 img.*.ppm type type size 128 128 view 70 20 box no 0 zoom 1.5 fix hull type 1 0
dump_modify im adiam * 0.2
run 0
